select 'Parking Garage Cleaning Services', 'Janitorial', 'PASS', 'County of Alameda issuer; P2 + GWE licensed (Dublin/Oakland/Fremont); ~50mi; prebid recommended (not mandatory); 31 days to close.', 'RFQ 902758', 'County of Alameda (GSA Parking Division)', 'County', 'Alameda', 'Alameda County', 'prospect', '2026-08-31'::date, 'N - Prebid Conference 08/06/2026 1:00 PM PDT (RECOMMENDED, not mandatory)', '2026-08-06'::date, '2026-08-07'::date, 'https://procurement.opengov.com/portal/acgov/projects/287567', 'Ning Peng', '510-208-9636', 'ning.peng2@acgov.org', 'Routine cleaning, maintenance & upkeep of 4 County-owned public parking garages (Alameda County GSA Parking Division).', '1) procurement.opengov.com/portal/acgov - create/log in vendor account. 2) Open project 287567 (RFQ 902758), click Follow. 3) Download RFQ + response template. 4) (Optional) attend 08/06 prebid. 5) Questions by 08/07 5:00 PM. 6) Submit quote in OpenGov before 08/31 2:00 PM PDT.', 'Prebid RECOMMENDED only (08/06 1:00 PM) - not required to bid. Confirm link: email ning.peng2@acgov.org or call 510-208-9636, or check OpenGov project 287567.', 'Subject: GWE - Intent to Bid, RFQ 902758 Parking Garage Cleaning

Hi Ning,

Great Way Environmental is a licensed commercial cleaning contractor serving Alameda County. We''re preparing a quote for RFQ 902758 - Parking Garage Cleaning Services (closing 08/31).

Could you confirm the required insurance & bond limits and the vendor-registration step in OpenGov? Want to make sure our submission is complete.

Appreciate it,
Fernando Gonzalez
Great Way Environmental'
where not exists (select 1 from bids where solicitation_no = 'RFQ 902758');
